        "description": "ThingLink XR offers an easy way to access your own immersive learning content on Meta headsets. Create dedicated content channels for employee onboarding, product and safety training, customer education, and more – then share conveniently using customizable landing pages on ThingLink XR. Combined with ThingLink’s AI-Assisted content creation flow, ThingLink helps you modernize learning with flexible viewing across headsets, mobile, desktop and immersive meeting spaces.\n\nThingLink XR is ideal for customizing the experience for various types of learners and interest groups; students, employees, subcontractors or customers. ThingLink content modules can be shared on other platforms, or they work as a standalone immersive learning solution for immersive learning on Meta headsets. Individual learning analytics can be shared via xAPI.",
